  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "QUIC: add support for GREASE QUIC Bit",
  "description": "Add support for draft-thomson-quic-bit-grease extension.\n\nCommit a71ecfa2b53 added the decoding of GREASE QUIC Bit Transport parameter:\nthis patch decodes the QUIC (short) header according to this parameter.\n\nThe issue can be reproduced with the attached pcap: [quic-31_grease_quic_bit__with_keys.pcapng](/uploads/3aaeb51b4f63db7735f8627c527b967c/quic-31_grease_quic_bit__with_keys.pcapng). Without this change, the packets matching the filter \"frame.number in {49 68 355 356 362 379 655 674 677 683 687 695 710 859 898 968 969 993 995 1127 1152 1164}\" are not properly decoded.",
  "state": "closed",
